{"lyrics":"[00:00.44]Music doesn't come from your mind\n[00:03.74]It comes from your soul\n[00:05.54]Mm-mm, mm-mm, mm (Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)\n[00:16.34]Oh, oh, oh\n[00:16.68]Mm-mm, mm\n[00:17.08]I served my time for all my crimes\n[00:19.02]Sittin' here, feeling so terrified\n[00:22.02]And no one knows where the answer lies\n[00:27.82]How you gon' tell me what I gotta live without?\n[00:30.46]When you don't know half the things that I live without\n[00:33.62]I highly doubt\n[00:34.82]That you have the same things holding you down\n[00:38.60]This is me telling you, you would never understand\n[00:41.36]Things ain't what they seem from the outside looking in\n[00:44.32]Unexplainable, unexplainable, unexplainable\n[00:48.38]Even if you look again\n[00:51.08]Even if you look again\n[00:53.84]Even if you look again\n[00:56.22]Yeah, even if you look again\n[01:00.44]In the back of my head, there's something haunting\n[01:03.30]I know it wants me to end up lonely\n[01:05.78]I'm searching for my peace, somebody help me\n[01:08.94]Feels like I'm about to die slowly\n[01:11.36]Um, runnin' 'round, runnin' 'round in my soul\n[01:14.04]It's been a couple years, still don't feel whole\n[01:16.90]At least I found home, she's all I know\n[01:19.78]So I'll be damned if I let her go\n[01:22.32]This is me telling you, you would never understand\n[01:35.18]Things ain't what they seem from the outside looking in\n[01:47.02]Unexplainable, unexplainable, unexplainable\n[01:50.24]Even if you look again\n[01:51.84]Even if you look again\n[01:52.90]Even if you look again\n[01:54.10]Yeah, even if you look again\n[01:55.34]You don't know what I\n[01:56.46]Need, I need my life\n[01:57.76]Back to the way that it was\n[01:59.04]Nowadays, I feel alone\n[02:00.04]Said I didn't have shit, but I had my friends\n[02:02.18]Nowadays, I don't really have no one to spend\n[02:03.50]Time with, so I'm in my head\n[02:04.66]Thinking 'bout what I should've said\n[02:06.86]Could've, would've, should've done it all\n[02:08.80]In my room with nothing but these walls\n[02:12.46]Feeling something I can't control\n[02:14.84]These demons taking over my soul\n[02:18.38]I can feel it\n[02:21.28]I can feel it\n[02:23.94]I can feel it\n[02:27.40]I can\n[02:29.32]This is me telling you, you would never understand\n[02:31.70]Things ain't what they seem from the outside looking in\n[02:34.68]Unexplainable, unexplainable, unexplainable\n[02:41.50]Even if you look again\n[02:44.18]Even if you look again\n[02:47.30]Even if you look again\n[03:00.88]Yeah, even if you look again","words":[[0.44,0.66,"Music"],[0.72,0.92,"doesn't"],[0.96,1.12,"come"],[1.16,1.26,"from"],[1.3,1.42,"your"],[1.46,3.7,"mind"],[3.74,3.76,"It"],[3.82,4.08,"comes"],[4.12,4.22,"from"],[4.3,4.4,"your"],[4.48,4.68,"soul"],[5.54,5.98,"Mm-mm,"],[7.22,7.36,"mm-mm,"],[7.9,7.94,"mm"],[8.02,16.2,"(Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)"],[16.34,16.36,"Oh,"],[16.52,16.54,"oh,"],[16.6,16.62,"oh"],[16.68,16.82,"Mm-mm,"],[16.86,16.9,"mm"],[17.08,17.08,"I"],[17.2,17.34,"served"],[17.38,17.4,"my"],[17.44,17.52,"time"],[17.56,17.8,"for"],[17.98,18.12,"all"],[18.24,18.46,"my"],[18.56,18.96,"crimes"],[19.02,19.62,"Sittin'"],[19.66,19.88,"here,"],[19.96,20.24,"feeling"],[20.3,20.4,"so"],[20.64,21.96,"terrified"],[22.02,22.06,"And"],[22.1,22.14,"no"],[22.28,22.48,"one"],[22.72,23.06,"knows"],[23.12,23.3,"where"],[23.42,23.5,"the"],[23.6,23.84,"answer"],[24.12,27.78,"lies"],[27.82,27.86,"How"],[27.94,28.06,"you"],[28.1,28.16,"gon'"],[28.24,28.5,"tell"],[28.6,28.66,"me"],[28.78,28.94,"what"],[29.0,29.0,"I"],[29.1,29.34,"gotta"],[29.44,29.72,"live"],[29.82,30.16,"without?"],[30.46,30.62,"When"],[30.7,30.92,"you"],[30.98,31.06,"don't"],[31.18,31.32,"know"],[31.36,31.42,"half"],[31.46,31.54,"the"],[31.7,32.02,"things"],[32.06,32.2,"that"],[32.28,32.28,"I"],[32.46,32.7,"live"],[32.74,33.22,"without"],[33.62,33.62,"I"],[33.78,34.2,"highly"],[34.3,34.64,"doubt"],[34.82,34.98,"That"],[35.02,35.1,"you"],[35.2,35.3,"have"],[35.34,35.38,"the"],[35.5,35.78,"same"],[35.86,36.1